WEBVTT

00:07:28.903 --> 00:07:30.196
Once mainstream,

00:07:30.196 --> 00:07:32.865
twerking was misunderstood
and taken out of context.

00:07:33.824 --> 00:07:34.867
It was bittersweet.

00:07:35.159 --> 00:07:36.327
For one,

00:07:36.327 --> 00:07:39.997
I wish that a Black woman could have
popularized twerking in the mainstream.

00:07:39.997 --> 00:07:41.582
But on the other end,

00:07:41.582 --> 00:07:45.920
twerking going mainstream played a role
in the rise of my profile and my career.

00:07:47.004 --> 00:07:48.005
Listen.

00:07:48.923 --> 00:07:50.716
Everything that Black people create,

00:07:50.716 --> 00:07:53.260
from fashion to music to the way we talk,

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:56.514
is co-opted, appropriated
and taken by pop culture.

00:07:56.514 --> 00:08:01.227
(Applause)